    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want to take \"small steps\" to just keep existing in this misery. it feels like i'm just prolonging the inevitable. the pain isn't going away, it's just becoming part of me. even you, elara... you're trying so hard to help, but it's like trying to hold back the ocean with your bare hands. there's no light at the end of this, is there? i just want the noise to stop. i want it all to be quiet.",
